        "# List comprehension\n",
        "\n",
        "A list comprehension constructs a list from an iterable using an expression and optional filters: `[x*x for x in range(3)]` produces `[0, 1, 4]`.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-list-comprehension)"
      ]
    }
